## Order
- Parts 4 → 5 → 6 can start before the engine lands (client only).
- Plan 34 (OQ-29) + M2 PORT-7 → part 1 → part 2 → part 3.
- Part 7 after plan 26 and part 5 (glyph credits); its screen needs part 4.
