- US-only patterns: a module constant, e.g. `PD-US*` but not `PD-USGov*`, `PD-1923`, `PD-Harris-Ewing`. `PD-USGov*`, `PD-old-*` (incl. `PD-old-70-1923`), `PD-self`, `PD-author`, `PD-Art`, `PD-textlogo`, … are ok.
