Then `pm decision add "Steam binding for the Electron shell?"`, recommended option first, body ultra-short (key facts, links). Add a follow-up task in plan 54, `pm task-pending-decision` on it: record the answer in D-63 (consequences line, `plans/decisions.md`) and plan 18 (SW-2 note, SW-8 wording). Done when the decision and the pending follow-up task exist.', '2026-10-12T03:38:13Z', '2026-10-12T14:42:47Z', 313);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task) VALUES (318, 54, 'Desktop shell: whole game without Python, docs', 'work', 'done', 470, '2026-10-12, plans/decisions.md (D-71), plans/18-steam-integration.md (SW-2 [x]), plans/19-repo-layout.md, directory.md, AGENTS.md, README.md, plans/project.md; CDP under Xvfb, no Python: new player → level 12 victory, all 5 jokers, undo, abandon, 22 media loaded (img/audio), pool video seeks, 13 samples decode, console clean, media dir unchanged; play test pm decision 29 → task 355; binding decision 28 → task 353; check, build, qgen validate pass', 'Last task of plan 54 (SW-2). Needs this plan''s three desktop-shell tasks and task 298; if one isn''t done, stop and say so. Resolve any TODO left for this task by the bridge task (store choice).

